Third-party material

authority_trail/ed25519.py is adapted from the Python reference implementation printed in
RFC 8032 (Edwards-Curve Digital Signature Algorithm), section 6. Code components extracted
from IETF RFCs are provided under the Revised BSD licence, per the IETF Trust Legal
Provisions in effect for that RFC. The RFC authors are S. Josefsson and I. Liusvaara.
This copy was re-typed and modified (public-key admission checks, input handling); it is not
the unmodified RFC text.

The Ed25519 test vectors in tests/test_crypto.py are the public vectors from RFC 8032 section 7.1.

web/verify.html uses the browser's Web Crypto API and has no third-party code.
